    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Match-3 game &quot;Jewel Legends - Atlantis&quot; you have to discover the secrets of Atlantis and repair the magnificent city! Build rows of three or more of the same symbol - you will have huge chains built before you know it! Collect ancient artifacts and secret treasures that you can use to build your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tRestore Atlantis to its former glory in this tile-matching adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t140 levels and 8 bonus tools</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tBuild marvelous structures such as the Crystal Forge, the Mushroom Farm and the Tavern</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t3 game modes -  Adventure, Tournament and Freeplay - plus Challenging Mini Games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Match-3 game &quot;Jewel Legends - Atlantis&quot; you have to discover the secrets of Atlantis and repair the magnificent city! Build rows of three or more of the same symbol - you will have huge chains built before you know it! Collect ancient artifacts and secret treasures that you can use to build your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tRestore Atlantis to its former glory in this tile-matching adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t140 levels and 8 bonus tools</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tBuild marvelous structures such as the Crystal Forge, the Mushroom Farm and the Tavern</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t3 game modes -  Adventure, Tournament and Freeplay - plus Challenging Mini Games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
